# Customer, client and candidate data never goes in this repository. These are the files it
# travels in: spreadsheets and CSVs (ClickUp and CRM exports, imports), CRM backups and sync
# files, resumes, invoices, contact cards, emails and database dumps. CI fails if one is added.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.ods
*.numbers
*.jmbak
*.jmcrm
